0xF880 to 0xF8FD, 0xF980 to 0xF9FD, etc up to 0xFCF9 are semi-solid and
solid 2x2 mosaics, each quarter is one of the following:
  0 = blank
  1 = light shade
  2 = medium shade
  3 = heavy shade
  4 = solid
Then apply the multiplier as follows:
  0 = top right
  5 = top left
  25 = bottom right
  125 = bottom left
This is then made linear to hi/lo according to the range given above.


